cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite study V0.2 and the manuscript separately as described in CITATION.md. Dataset and preprint DOIs are reserved; Zenodo records remain unpublished at preparation."
type: dataset
title: "Rank-Two Mordell–Weil Lattice Shape Census for Elliptic Curves of Conductor Below 50,000 (Study V0.2)"
version: "0.2"
authors:
  - family-names: Mladenovski
    given-names: Toni
    affiliation: Independent researcher
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8343-662X"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible finite census of 23,612 rank-two elliptic-curve records and
  18,886 predetermined isogeny-class representatives from a pinned version of
  J. E. Cremona's ecdata for conductors below 50,000. The associated manuscript
  is version 0.3.4. Numerical heights use PARI/GP; rank and full-basis
  assumptions are inherited from the database. The repository contains exact
  V0.2 source files and selected stored summaries, with pinned input retrieval.
  Component-specific licensing is described in licenses/LICENSE_SCOPE.md.
keywords:
  - elliptic curves
  - Mordell-Weil lattices
  - canonical heights
  - lattice reduction
  - reproducibility
repository-code: "https://github.com/eit-orbitos/BSD_MW_RANK2_SHAPE_CENSUS_50000"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24484435"
